"tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "fucking~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " die?\u201d ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "Harvey~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "repeated~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": ". ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Mhm.\u201d Rachel said. \u201cI mean, no. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "It mighta broke a rib, but I think it\u2019d hurt more. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "It\u2019s lucky that driver didn\u2019t have any more runway, or you\u2019d be toast.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "...~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeTag", "text": "ProfileImage |sarah_noir.png | Who = Sarah ~", "codeMarker": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeMarker", "tag": "P3342", "parent": "code_5f_marker", "fontCol": null, "bgCol": null, "isSub": false, "isSheeted": false}, "isEndTag": false, "params": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeParams", "lparams": [], "dparams": {}, "obj": "ProfileImage |sarah_noir.png | Who = Sarah", "hasColon": false}, "obj": "ProfileImage |sarah_noir.png | Who = Sarah~"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Oh, shit. It\u2019s my client.\u201d Harvey said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Harvey picked up the phone. \u201cThe default is starving, you\u2019ve got Harvey.\u201d ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "How\u2019s it going?\u201d Sarah said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Bad. Some goon jumped on me. Metallic~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": ".\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P623", "text": "...~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "I\u2019ll find somewhere safe for the boxer.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "No, that\u2019s okay.\u201d ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Well, surely, you\u2019ve been taken out of the ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "fight? If ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "anybody tries to take another swing at you two, you\u2019ll be cooked!\u201d ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Yeah, but, like, she\u2019s good. So, no need to start moving ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "people ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "around. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "And maybe she likes it here.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P623", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Harvey, I know it\u2019s an honor thing. And I commend that. But really, if she\u2019s not safe, and she\u2019s bringing you trouble, I can take her at my place!\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "I got a message. From George Soros.\u201d Harvey said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Oh, shit!\u201d Sarah said. \u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P618", "text": "The~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P618", "text": " George Soros?\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Yeah, so, she better stay with me.\u201d Harvey said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "What\u2019d it say?\u201d Sarah said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Was like... normal stuff.\u201d Harvey said. \u201cIt\u2019s probably like, spreading antisemitism if I share it.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "How.\u201d Sarah demanded.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Well, he\u2019s like, threatening a woman.\u201d Harvey said. \u201cIt\u2019s not a good look.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c...\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201cPlus, we\u2019ve already got a cooking arrangement going.\u201d Harvey said. \u201cShe cooks wild rice, and I cook lo mein. It\u2019s a nutritional complement. Otherwise, her diet\u2019s going to be way out of balance.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201c...\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201cPlus-\u201d Harvey said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "Sarah hung up. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3531", "text": "\u201cDamn broad.\u201d Harvey said. \u201cShe\u2019s gonna cost me my broad.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3531", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.Header", "font": "Heading_2", "text": "Climate Change~", "_align": "center"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeTag", "text": "Subtitle: Climate Change~", "codeMarker": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeMarker", "tag": "P3397", "parent": "code_5f_marker", "fontCol": null, "bgCol": null, "isSub": false, "isSheeted": false}, "isEndTag": false, "params": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeParams", "lparams": ["Climate Change~"], "dparams": {}, "obj": "Subtitle", "hasColon": true}, "obj": "Subtitle~"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "A dozen scientists got together, and cowrote a paper, saying the climate was changing. It\u2019s bold. It\u2019s interesting. It\u2019s a compelling claim. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeTag", "text": "Image: scientists.jpg~", "codeMarker": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeMarker", "tag": "P3262", "parent": "code_5f_marker", "fontCol": null, "bgCol": null, "isSub": false, "isSheeted": false}, "isEndTag": false, "params": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeParams", "lparams": ["scientists.jpg~"], "dparams": {}, "obj": "Image", "hasColon": true}, "obj": "Image~"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Presumably, they weren\u2019t able to say everything they wanted. They stopped short of telling us what we should ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "do~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": ". ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Newspapers agreed. Every news anchor agreed, in no uncertain terms, that the scientists were right. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeTag", "text": "Image: journalist_cute.jpg~", "codeMarker": {"py/id": 3770}, "isEndTag": false, "params": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeParams", "lparams": ["journalist_cute.jpg~"], "dparams": {}, "obj": "Image", "hasColon": true}, "obj": "Image~"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Other scientists agreed. None of them were able, or at least, not willing, to disprove the claims. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "That leaves us with a question. A simple, clear, and easy-to-understand question. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3548", "text": "Who is responsible for this ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {