ct": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201cMoses was fighting against numbskulled denialists. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "He was~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": " trying to ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "prevent ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "an impending disaster.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "In Ancient Egyptian times, Dieties were made up and written about like OC\u2019s. They were sold like Funko Pops. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Occassionally a~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": " Diet~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "y~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "would try to ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "take over the government. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "They, of course, were never successful. The State took them as silly and dismissible, even as Dieties began making more ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "and more sense. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Egyptian state philosophy, on the other hand, was falling apart. Disproving unprovables. Every action a crime. Dunking on inconvenient truths. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "That\u2019s why ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Moses did his OC differently. T~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "here ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "was ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "n~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "othing~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": " about God. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "God likes good things, ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "not ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "bad things. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "You know, like ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "the Unifying Force that holds us together~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "? ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "People said, ah, yes, ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "we know ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "God~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": ".~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "So ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "my Diety,~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "God,~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " said we shouldn\u2019t let the Pharoah kill all those Hebrew babies. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "And people said, \u201cWhat, ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "now? Kill Hebrew babies?~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Moses was ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "massively~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "oversimplifying, ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "of course~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": ". What Moses was referring to was a policy that may have endangered the lives of ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "a ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "few~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " Hebrew children. \u201cAll\u201d was ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "an ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "exaggeration. \u201cHide in baskets\u201d was ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "unhelpful advice~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": ". ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "So, Moses informed his audience what to do. Show up at the Pharoah\u2019s workplace, and tell him to knock it off or perish.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Harvey raised his eyebrows, waiting for a response.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201cAh.\u201d the man said, gulping. \u201cI didn\u2019t know that.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201cBut, that\u2019s why I keep the Torah in my Heart.\u201d Harvey said. \u201cIt brings me hope to know that a man could tell the Head of State to fuck off. I think we need a little more of that. I think the world would be a better place.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Got it.\u201d the man said. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Moses ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "did keep the Ring, though. He ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "realized he had a banger on his hands, and decided to ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "take over Hebrew Canaan ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "instead of throwing ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "a ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "lengthy ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "revolution in Egypt.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "But God ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": "is~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P1310", "text": " real.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "No, that\u2019s the first time I thought of that.\u201d the man said, knocking over a table. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "Harvey raised his eyebrows. \u201cI\u2019m surprised you didn\u2019t know about the force that binds us all together.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201cNo, I knew, I didn\u2019t know you knew,\u201d the man cursed, fumbling to pick it up. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "And the Dark Wizards?\u201d Harvey said. \u201cPharoah\u2019s magicians. Probably, the word \u201cMagician\u201d was different in those times.\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "\u201c~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P3552", "text": "That I believed.\u201d the man growled. He looked Harvey in his eyes, and then left out the door. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.Header", "font": "Heading_2", "text": "Lunchish~", "_align": "center"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeTag", "text": "When: 12AM, Friday~", "codeMarker": {"py/id": 5431}, "isEndTag": false, "params": {"py/object": "objects.code_objects.CodeParams", "lparams": ["12AM, Friday~"], "dparams": {}, "obj": "When", "hasColon": true}, "obj": "W