", "text": "like I did~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2711", "text": ". Then there\u2019s the fuse. That\u2019s made out of a slow-burning material, like cloth, so the bomb can be thrown from long distance. We don\u2019t throw em ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2711", "text": "at~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2711", "text": " the factory, though! That\u2019s a big no-no. We had this new girl come in, and ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "T1710_T1935_T1973_T1935_T898_T1935_T1973_T1935_T343_T898_T343_T898_T343_T1935_T898_T1935_T898_T343_T344_T1710_Grok", "text": "she got in the biggest trouble~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "T1710_T1935_T1973_T1935_T898_T1935_T1973_T1935_T343_T898_T343_T898_T343_T1935_T898_T1935_T898_T343_T344_T1710_Grok", "text": " for throwing bombs. You should have seen the manager yell. I hope your dad never yells at you like that. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "T1710_T1935_T1973_T1935_T898_T1935_T1973_T1935_T343_T898_T343_T898_T343_T1935_T898_T1935_T898_T343_T344_T1710_Grok", "text": "Don\u2019t throw any bombs~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "T1710_T1935_T1973_T1935_T898_T1935_T1973_T1935_T343_T898_T343_T898_T343_T1935_T898_T1935_T898_T343_T344_T1710_Grok", "text": ", and you should be alright. Heh heh!\u201d ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P3552", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.Header", "font": "Heading_3", "text": "\u201cYou are Grok, a Large Language Model created by ~", "_align": "l