019 vastly different relationships towards antisemitism can be leveraged into full blown global war. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "2. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Move Billionaires and Blessed above 61st parallel.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": ".~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "The move will be billed as a flat-earth cult, founded in LA. Membership will be offered but not granted. The choice of Greenland will be explained by our fascination with the ice wall. We will use considerable money to mis-advertise.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "3. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Annoint ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Cptn~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": ". ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "McKinsey~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": " Savior of the Blessed.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "During the hardest point of the war, our enemies will seem to have us completely defeated, with an attack on our own technology. Adml. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "McKinsey~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": " will deliver a religious sermon, declaring that Israel is either good or evil, whichever the moment calls for. After this, the attack on our technology will end. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "Joel Osteen will them proclaim Adml. Reynolds the Messiah, activating our Fundamentalists. They will then serve as Adml. Reynolds\u2019 foot soldiers. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "We will then use the Messiah to recruit young soldiers, and station them in defensive positions in the North. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "4. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Provoke wars along 40th parallel. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "At this point our plan will be publicly-known but unconfirmed. In order to prevent a unified uprising, we will carry out drone strikes and fund terror cells along the 40th parallel, provoking war through the same route as the I/P conflict.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "It should be no problem to silence negative coverage.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "5. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Induct Northeners as \u201cAspiring Citizens\u201d~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "At this point, we will tacitly admit our plan to Northerners. We will us religion ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": " ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "and mental health to lock down their media consumption. We will sanctimoniously welcome them in while providing basic necessities. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "6. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Let Climate Change deal with Southglobers.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "They have seen our faces. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "No witnesses to ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "the ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "last millenia. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "Once they\u2019re all gone, we\u2019ll use AI to invent history around what really happened to them. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "7. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Build Hands.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "Thiel has shown us some very interesting demonstrations with robotics. While we don\u2019t think the plans are viable yet, we think that they will be within 100 years. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "Thiel has assured us that while the Hands will be somewhat autonomous, they can easily be shut down with failsafes.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "8. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Decimate Northeners.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "The Northeners will not forget what we did, nor will they let us live it down. Their people have always tried to kill us. Never forget the Tzars of Russia. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "Deploy the Hands on all but the most timid citizens.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "9. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Gene-edit remaining ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Workers~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": " into Steeds.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2932", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2932", "text": "The seed of the peasant has been preserved. Now it can be perfected into workhorses. Thiel is confident that gene editing can be solved within a few centuries. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.MiscToken", "type": "soft-page-break"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2633", "text": "10. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2629", "text": "Rule forever as ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "T2328_P2629", "text": "Soup.~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2637", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2638", "text": "Though we may not reach that day ourselves, our descendants will become effectively immortal. By reducing stress on each organ, and by having backups nearby, we can circumvent the natural process of aging. ~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.NewLine", "font": "P2189", "amt": 1}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2189", "text": "---~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.misc_text_obj.EndOfPara"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "font": "P2189", "text": "-~", "tabs": 0, "_align": "left"}, {"py/object": "objects.text_obj.TextSpan", "f